// The control plane's link to its hosted recorders.
//
// Internal, like the relay link: nothing outside the deployment speaks it, and
// its Go output lands under `internal/` so nothing outside the control plane can
// import it. Pull rather than push, so the control plane needs no way to start a
// process: a pool of recorder workers asks for work, renews the credential it
// joined with, and reports what it stored. A worker that stops renewing loses
// its lease, and the recording is handed to another worker, which resumes it
// under the same storage prefix.
